  "name": "Chicken Chili Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty chicken and bean soup with peppers, corn, and warm spices.",
  "description": "Chicken, colorful peppers, beans, corn, and tomatoes simmer together with chili powder and cumin for a generously sized soup.",
